# Locators

Keep locators inside pages and components, never in tests. Prefer semantic locators.

Priority: `getByRole` → `getByLabel` → `getByPlaceholder` → `getByText` → `getByTestId` → stable CSS → XPath only if necessary.

Do not use generated CSS classes, `nth-child` unless unavoidable, positional or deep XPath, or dynamic framework attributes.

Do not store all locators in JSON unless a proven maintenance benefit exists.

```typescript
// ✅
this.page.getByRole('button', { name: 'Create candidate' });

// ❌
this.page.locator('div.sc-a1b2c3 > div:nth-child(4)');
```
